hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"931","Muhammad bin Othman Al-Ijli told us, Ubaid Allah, meaning Ibn Musa, told us, on the authority of Shayban, h Muhammad bin Amr bin Tammam Al-Masry told us, Yusuf bin Adiy told us, Abu Al-Ahwas told us all, on the authority of Ash'ath, who is the son of Abi Al-Sha'atha', on the authority of his father, on the authority of Masruq, on the authority of Aisha, She said: I asked the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, about a man’s turning away during prayer, and he said: “It is a misappropriation by Satan of a servant’s prayer.” And in the hadith of Ubayd Allah about turning around during prayer"
